<title>USA: Moore unit, Tyson Foods in pact.</title>
<headline>Moore unit, Tyson Foods in pact.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moore USA Inc, a subsidiary of Moore Corp Ltd, said it signed a five-year agreement to provide document management services for Tyson Foods Inc.</p>
<p>Moore USA said it would use its PC-based technology platform, MooreNet.</p>
<p>Moore said the program will enable Tyson to increase control, apply emerging technologies and reduce the overall costs associated with its business communications processes.</p>
<p>The value of the agreement was not disclosed.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
